<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr><td align="center" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><a href="https://new.columbus.gov/Government/Mayors-Office/Office-of-Diversity-and-Inclusion?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Mayor's Office of Diversity &amp; Inclusion Website" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2025/11/12679876/6552013/outreach-banner_crop.png" style="width: 540px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="ODI Outreach Banner " width="540" height="180"></a></td></tr></table>
<div>
<div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;">Greetings,</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;">The Office of Diversity and Inclusion is collaborating with Councilmember Nick Bankston’s office to create a special edition of Mahogany Columbus Magazine for the City of Columbus. This edition will showcase small, minority-owned businesses along with the various opportunities and initiatives available within the city.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;">This feature presents a unique chance for city departments and select vendors to highlight their individual initiatives related to small, minority-owned businesses through a <strong>half page advertisement</strong> (detailed specifications are provided below).</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;">If you’re interested in being included in this special edition of Mahogany Columbus, please submit your content via <a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/07bc3a48d3934a79850c9651526b52b6?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #00549b;">Mahogany Columbus Ad Submission Form</a> by Thursday, December 18th, at 5 PM.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;">All submissions will be reviewed, but due to limited space, not all can be included.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0 0 10px;"> </p>
</div>
</div>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2025/11/12674703/6549467/mcaddesignspecs_crop.png" style="width: 540px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="Mahogany Columbus Ad Specifications " width="540" height="269"><p class="gd_caption" style="width: 100%; text-align: left; font-size: 8pt; font-style: italic; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; color: #1d1d1e; margin: 0;" align="left">Design and Print Specifications for Mahogany Columbus Magazine</p>
